================================================================================
      sigma      A neg-eig nodes    exact(MC's field)/exact(as evaluated)
        8.00            0                      1.000135   (+0.013%)
        4.00            1                      1.000336   (+0.034%)
        2.00            2                      1.028741   (+2.874%)
        1.00            2                      1.000039   (+0.004%)
        0.50            2                      1.000004   (+0.000%)
      -> +0.014% at sigma = 8 and +0.034% at sigma = 4 (the anchors),
